{"product":{"id":8078758084686,"title":"Afnan Woody Essentials Discovery Set","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis set brings together three distinctive Afnan creations — a fresh spicy woody signature, an earthy aromatic blend, and a vibrant citrus-woody fragrance. Three miniatures that showcase the refined versatility of Afnan before going full bottle.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInside:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTribute Blue\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is bergamot, pimento, and nutmeg over cashmere wood and amber, settling into vetiver, incense, and musk — fresh, spicy, and sophisticated.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHighness X\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is bergamot, black currant, and tonka bean over patchouli, vetiver, and earthy notes, settling into spices, musk, and guaiac wood — woody, warm, and refined.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTurathi Blue\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is bergamot and mandarin over amber and woody accords, settling into musk, patchouli, and fresh spice — citrusy, smooth, and effortlessly confident.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThree Afnan woody essentials, one exceptional set — the perfect way to discover your next signature fragrance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Scentira","product_type":"Bundle","created_at":"2026-09-18T14:03:28+05:30","handle":"afnan-woody-essentials-sample-set-tribute-blue-highness-x-turathi-blue-3-1-5ml","updated_at":"2026-09-23T1